direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode plain
typeface clean

"Users and Roles" [color: "#d6b656"] {
  Admin [label: "ADMIN", icon: user]
  Planner [label: "PLANNER", icon: user]
  WarehouseManager [label: "WAREHOUSE MANAGER", icon: user]
  Analyst [label: "ANALYST", icon: user]
}

"Frontend Hosting" [color: "#6c8ebf"] {
  ReactBuild [label: "React dashboard", icon: layout-dashboard]
  VercelNetlify [label: "Vercel / Netlify", icon: cloud]
}

"Application Hosting" [color: "#6c8ebf"] {
  Backend [label: "Node.js + Express API", icon: server]
  MLService [label: "Python + FastAPI", icon: cpu]
  Docker [label: "Docker Compose local", icon: package]
}

"Managed Data and AI" [color: "#b85450"] {
  PostgreSQL [label: "Supabase / AWS RDS PostgreSQL", icon: database]
  VectorStore [label: "Vector store", icon: database]
  LLM [label: "OpenAI API / self-hosted LLM", icon: message-circle]
}

"Security Boundary" [color: "#d6b656"] {
  Login [label: "Login", icon: lock]
  PasswordHash [label: "bcrypt password hashing", icon: key]
  JWT [label: "JWT HMAC-SHA256, 24h", icon: shield]
  RBAC [label: "Role middleware", icon: shield]
  Audit [label: "Audit logging", icon: clipboard]
}

Admin, Planner, WarehouseManager, Analyst > ReactBuild
ReactBuild > VercelNetlify
ReactBuild > Login: credentials
Login > PasswordHash
Login > JWT: token
JWT > RBAC: Bearer token
RBAC > Backend: protected REST routes
Backend > PostgreSQL: SQL / ORM
Backend > MLService: REST /predict
Backend > VectorStore: RAG retrieval
MLService > LLM: optional knowledge call
Backend > Audit: record action
Docker --> Backend: local development
Docker --> MLService: local development
Admin > RBAC: full access
Planner > RBAC: forecast and recommendations
WarehouseManager > RBAC: inventory editing
Analyst > RBAC: read-only dashboard
